# NOTHING PRIVATE IS INSTALLED HERE.
#
# This used to point @easydev-org at GitHub Packages, because the easybus SDK came from there. The
# protocol moved to Go, so this package now depends only on `playwright-core` and the Connect/web
# packages — all public. The token, the registry override and `strict-ssl=false` are gone with it:
# a build that needs no credential is a build that cannot leak one.
